Finds the places in the recording that talk about something (by meaning and by words; the recording only, not the internet). Returns fragments with times. The query must make sense on its own: write who and what is meant instead of «she», «that» or «it» from the chat. Optional: speaker — a label (@s1) to put that speaker's replies first; from and to — times (m:ss or h:mm:ss) to search only that part of the recording, for example when the question is about the first 30 minutes.
